\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Gu advanced to the Big Air finals at her first qualifying competition on Monday, after being introduced by the announcer as a "favorite" and drawing a roar from the excited crowd. But it's unclear whether that adulation will continue if Gu doesn't deliver the gold medals she's tipped to win.}
